  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3497682c-f58b-5cf5-b941-78b0cb319d92" activityNameId="889e0f10-fbe1-50ed-be4e-04e2b728583b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ground granulated blast furnace slag, with burdens, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ground granulated blast furnace slag, with burdens, at plant
This dataset represents the treatment of molten blast furnace slag, producing an output of ground granulated blast furnace slag (GGBFS, also referred to as slag cement). The burden from blast furnace slag is included.\nTechnology: Industry data.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Bindemittel\nUVEK 2022 source file:551-Zement-Klinker_v0.13_UVEK2021._GroundgrBFS.xml\n\n
UUID: 6f9f9a30-e31a-3684-ae6f-fa17a9b39ca0
This inventory for production of GGBFS encompasses the process steps (i) quenching/granulation, (ii) dewatering and/or drying, (iii) crushing, (iv) grinding, and (v) storage in pile and silo. The dataset includes the inert waste generated as a by-product, most important emissions, infrastructure and transport processes
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Extrapolation from the US dataset, which was estimated to be based on 90% of the total US production, to represent the RoW 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f9f9a30-e31a-3684-ae6f-fa17a9b39ca0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
